    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 779 of the laws of 1986, amending the social services law relating to authorizing services for non-residents in adult homes, residences for adults and enriched housing programs, in relation to extending the provisions thereof for three years",
    "basePrintNo": "S5339",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5339-2011",
    "coSponsors": {
